Show
	BaseType == "Orb of Transmutation" "Greater Orb of Transmutation" "Perfect Orb of Transmutation" "Orb of Augmentation" "Greater Orb of Augmentation" "Regal Orb" "Greater Regal Orb" "Orb of Alchemy" "Blacksmith's Whetstone" "Artificer's Orb" "Artificer's Shard" "Regal Shard"
